d 'STATASHINY': module to build interactive HTML dashboards, calculators, and data tables from Stata
d
d  statashiny generates standalone, interactive HTML dashboards
d from Stata using Bootstrap 5 (layout), DataTables
d (searchable/sortable tables), and Chart.js (live charts). Define
d numeric and checkbox inputs, value cards, data tables from
d variables in memory, and JavaScript-driven visualizations that
d recompute in the browser -- no web-dev required. Output is a
d single self-contained .html file you can email, host, or embed
d via <iframe> (pairs naturally with webdoc2 reports). 
d
d KW: dashboard; html; interactive; bootstrap; datatables; chartjs; reporting; visualization
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f statashiny.ado
f statashiny.sthlp
